<title>USA: Premier Bankshares considering merger.</title>
<headline>Premier Bankshares considering merger.</headline>
<dateline>BLUEFIELD, Va. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Bankshares Corp said Monday it is considering a merger proposal and has retained an investment adviser.</p>
<p>The company said it has hired Scott &amp; Stringfellow Financial Inc.</p>
<p>Premier said it would release further information &quot;when appropriate.&quot;</p>
